                                                "sense_id": "771a9ce8-0ff9-3caf-9588-54e1b51d4a3d",
                                                "text": "A tiger handler who had acquired some of his tigers from the zoo owner known as Joe Exotic was fatally mauled on Saturday by a tiger at his family-run zoo in southeastern Oklahoma, the authorities said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
